      <h2>Which skirt length is which?</h2>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:12px">Skirt lengths are measured from the natural waist. Enter your height, and the heel height of the shoes you&#8217;ll wear with a maxi, to get approximate waist-to-hem measurements for each style.</p>
      <div class="lenform"><label for="ht">Your height (cm)<input type="number" id="ht" min="130" max="210" value="165"></label><label for="heel">Heel height (cm)<input type="number" id="heel" min="0" max="15" value="3"></label></div>
      <ul class="dots" style="margin-top:20px"><li>Measure from your natural waist, the narrowest point of your torso.</li><li>Petticoats should sit about 2&ndash;3 cm shorter than the skirt.</li><li>Try skirts on with the shoes you plan to wear.</li></ul>
    </div>
